            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;PreQual (KnockOuts)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;[Ask…]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;Have you ever been declined for life, health, or disability insurance? [KO, if yes]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;Are you currently confined to a hospital or long-term care facility? [KO, if yes]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-cursor&quot;&gt;﻿&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;Have you been diagnosed as terminally ill? [KO, if yes]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;[Confirm…]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;US citizen [KO, if no]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;DOB [KO, if not 50-85]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;State [KO, if CA, NY, MT, or LA]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
