        <fields>
            <name>Step3</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;Step 3: Needs Analysis (SIFE)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;Leading Questions/Statements…&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: black;&quot;&gt;A lot of people I talk to aren’t quite sure what they’re looking for and want me to give them some advice. Do you have some thoughts about what you need?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: black;&quot;&gt;So tell me more about why you’re thinking about coverage today?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: black;&quot;&gt;One thing I hear a lot is that people want Life Insurance, but they just don’t want to go through a difficult process to get it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: black;&quot;&gt;It seems like you’re looking to protect your&amp;lt;family&amp;gt; and provide some money when you pass away. Is that right?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: black;&quot;&gt;You’re doing a great thing we all want to make sure our &amp;lt;family&amp;gt; has the resources they need no matter what happens&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;[use opportunities to set the table about products with simple process, no exam, no waiting]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;[once clear on FE need] In order to get you the right product and amount of coverage tell me about what your final wishes might look like? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;A burial generally costs a little under $10,000 while cremation is usually a little bit cheaper around $6,000. Do you think you would also want to leave a little extra for your &amp;lt;family&amp;gt;? Do you have any debts that you wouldn’t want to leave with your &amp;lt;family&amp;gt;?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;It seems like we have a perfect fit here in terms of your needs! As you may recall the way life insurance works, your rates are determined by your age, your health and your lifestyle. And as part of the application process we will need to give the insurance company some personal information, like some information about your medical history and your social security number – we just like to make sure that’s all right with you up front!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
            <styleProperties>
                <verticalAlignment>
                    <stringValue>top</stringValue>
                </verticalAlignment>
                <width>
                    <stringValue>12</stringValue>
                </width>
            </styleProperties>
        </fields>
