            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: black; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Step 4: Quote&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;[run the quote] &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Estimating your price based on your age, and the information that you provided on the website we discussed it looks like it would cost around &amp;lt;premium&amp;gt; per month. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;[adjust for any budget]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;In order to refine that number and make sure we’ve got everything right for you I have a few health questions that we can go through. These are the same kind of questions that the insurance company will have for you, we just want to ask them up front and make sure we have the right solution for you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Does that sound reasonable for you?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
