            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;Step 5: Start EApp&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;[Start EApp]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;[voice acknowledgement] &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;Alright so we take your privacy SO seriously that we have a 3 minute recording for us both to listen to! Ready?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;[Hit the button in SF - REMEMBER TO MUTE YOURSELF IF NEEDED – use this time to prep your pre-qual notes]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;…&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;…&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;[Beneficiaries…] The primary beneficiary is the person you want to receive the benefit if you pass away – I think you mentioned &amp;lt;family member&amp;gt; is the person you want to receive these benefits?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;You can always add or change your beneficiaries in the future as well.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
