            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: black; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Step 6: Explain Next Steps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Congratulations! I have confirmation here that you’re covered!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Lumico will be mailing you a copy of your policy, it will take about 7 to 10 days to get to you. In the meantime you can also get a copy of your policy online through their client portal. You’ll receive an email from them soon with instructions on how to register. You can also use the portal if you need to add a beneficiary, change addresses, or change your payment info. They also have a customer service line you can call – can I give you that number?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;[when ready] Great, its 866-440-4047&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;And if anything comes to mind and you want to reach me or one of my colleagues here at Sage you can reach us at &amp;lt;number&amp;gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Once again, thank you for your time today and your business – You’ve taken a great step towards protecting &amp;lt;your family&amp;gt;. Congratulations!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
